{"id":"santa","lemma":"santa","pos":"noun","rank":939,"glosses":["saintess; female equivalent of santo"],"ipa":"/ˈsanta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"santas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-santa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Crees en Santa Claus?","en":"Do you believe in Santa Claus?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/797989","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},null,null]},{"text":"¿Adónde fuiste en las vacaciones de Semana Santa?","en":"Where did you go for the holidays?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1156886","words":[{"g":"to where"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"vacation, holiday","l":"vacación"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"week"},null]},{"text":"¿Creías en Santa Claus cuando eras niño?","en":"Did you believe in Santa Claus when you were a child?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300800","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},null,null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"era, age","l":"era"},{"g":"child, boy"}]},{"text":"Me pregunto si realmente Santa Claus existe.","en":"I wonder if there really is a Santa Claus.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615884","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to ask","l":"preguntar"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"really"},null,null,{"g":"to exist","l":"existir"}]},{"text":"El miércoles que viene empieza la Semana Santa.","en":"Easter begins next Wednesday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641912","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"Wednesday"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"week"},null]}]}